### `mcp__codex_app__list_artifacts`
List this chat's attached pull requests, active worktrees, archived worktrees, and other saved attachments. Subagents on hosts with thread attachments can also list attachments from their parent chats. Returns each supported attachment's type, identity, payload, and creation time; older hosts may only return pull requests. Items merely mentioned in messages or attached to unrelated chats are not included. This tool is part of plugin `codex-app-tools`.

